<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten values steady in light demand.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten values steady in light demand.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten prices were steady in light trade. Dealers said business had slowed from moderate trading last week and Monday.</p>
